[{"title":"匡云上人制斑竹龛奉佛归庐山偈以送之 其二","author":"李之世","text":"琉璃净滑露珠匀，中见如来妙净身。\n为问空明谁点缀，菩提无树镜无尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27821,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦词 其一","author":"李之世","text":"沿街爆竹闹新晴，车马喧喧彻夜行。\n侯门深锁真如海，不见阍人报晓更。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27822,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦词 其二","author":"李之世","text":"姣服时妆色色新，东邻逐队过西邻。\n红蛮笺帖通名氏，刚进厅前就转身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27823,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦词 其三","author":"李之世","text":"十条街巷九经过，那个相逢不绮罗。\n呼童好好注名籍，今日门庭好客多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27824,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦词 其四","author":"李之世","text":"弦管啁啾斗丽华，十分春色半豪家。\n堂前介福还增寿，过午青衣未散衙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27825,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦词 其五","author":"李之世","text":"长夜深闺闹不平，百般喧炒试年庚。\n女童听得鸡声叫，忙杀春妆恼未成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27826,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦词 其六","author":"李之世","text":"百褶罗裙稳称身，年年打扮庆嘉晨。\n东家人祝双双寿，莫管侬家二八春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27827,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦词 其七","author":"李之世","text":"巷南巷北喜匆匆，村酒村肴一般醲。\n笑杀东邻穷措大，瓦盘菜甲领春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27828,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦词 其八","author":"李之世","text":"薰风袅袅度屠苏，争道新年景物殊。\n莫怪荜门贫似旧，竹窗糊纸换桃符。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27829,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦词 其九","author":"李之世","text":"绀宇平明锁钥开，烧香队队谒如来。\n僧雏不惯持斋律，密阁安排庆岁杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27830,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦词 其十","author":"李之世","text":"祁祁女伴竞新妆，一道欢声绕画廊。\n殿前数罢阿罗汉，密语叮咛拈佛香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27831,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦词 其十一","author":"李之世","text":"不须扫径与应门，落叶萧萧护短垣。\n车马自来还自去，几曾片纸到贫轩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27832,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦词 其十二","author":"李之世","text":"谁道春风不世情，朱门偏闹荜门清。\n山禽未解东君意，犹搅残妆梦不成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27833,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦词 其十三","author":"李之世","text":"油幕香车细惹尘，家家门额贴宜春。\n朱楼别锁春消息，鸟语莺啼总殢人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27834,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦词 其十四","author":"李之世","text":"十样时妆一样同，青楼日日醉东风。\n游人只爱春长在，刚到春来恼杀侬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27835,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏咏荔枝盘词 其一","author":"李之世","text":"天然幻出有岩峦，面面看时几许宽。\n九曲武夷穿未过，请君来咽荔枝盘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27836,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏咏荔枝盘词 其二","author":"李之世","text":"饼饵那堪易荔枝，坡翁怪石未为奇。\n绛房冰粒无人嚼，施与庐山老衲师。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27837,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏咏荔枝盘词 其三","author":"李之世","text":"千峰流出玉浆寒，勾漏真人此炼丹。\n火枣交梨浑俗品，一盘擎出荔枝丸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27838,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏咏荔枝盘词 其四","author":"李之世","text":"树里丛丛荔子湾，石桥流水雪潺潺。\n江南六月榕荫道，谱入襄阳作砚山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27839,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过黄竹庵书一绝寄陈子明","author":"李之世","text":"昔年燕市盛遨游，此日青毡楚水头。\n同作波臣余更远，炎天四月下琼州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27840,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王尧韭以六忆诗见投和之 其一 忆行","author":"李之世","text":"盈盈罗袜隐湘裙，缥缈凌波去若云。\n时向落花堤畔望，春山澹澹晓烟分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27841,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王尧韭以六忆诗见投和之 其二 忆书","author":"李之世","text":"轻匀兔颖蘸麋脂，阵阵螺香拂玉池。\n锦字缄题频自看，碧窗宁许侍儿窥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27842,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王尧韭以六忆诗见投和之 其三 忆醉","author":"李之世","text":"甲帐宵然蜡炬红，海棠睡起怯东风。\n珊瑚半倚娇无力，一点难消珀晕浓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27843,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王尧韭以六忆诗见投和之 其四 忆歌","author":"李之世","text":"朱唇不动韵轻飏，宛宛新莺度绿杨。\n罗袂乍垂还乍举，微风时递麝黄香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27844,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王尧韭以六忆诗见投和之 其五 忆眠","author":"李之世","text":"窥人皓魄一轮孤，消得清宵此景无。\n就枕忽惊还独起，不知谁为解罗襦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27845,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王尧韭以六忆诗见投和之 其六 忆妆","author":"李之世","text":"菱花似水写秋光，画出双眉若个长。\n一片乌云翠可鉴，飞来小凤立中央。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27846,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王侯德政咏 其一 一庭化雨","author":"李之世","text":"森森桃李自成蹊，罨映甘棠万树齐。\n共道太平信有象，弦歌声满岛城西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27847,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王侯德政咏 其二 半榻清风","author":"李之世","text":"湘帘如水静琴张，听得清音不下堂。\n百里仁风嘘海畔，沧波如拭漾荣光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27848,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王侯德政咏 其三 奇甸烟清","author":"李之世","text":"群峰缥缈戴金鳌，万顷奔流喷玉涛。\n瘴雨蛮烟清似洗，扶桑捧出日轮高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27849,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王侯德政咏 其四 重溟波息","author":"李之世","text":"鲸鲵东徙燧烟消，海国风生杀气遥。\n一自伏波南渡后，狂澜谁更树铜标。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27850,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王侯德政咏 其五 肺石平反","author":"李之世","text":"秦镜高悬照胆明，圜扉风静不闻声。\n凭将一掬溟波水，来洗人间冤滞情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27851,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王侯德政咏 其六 岩城保障","author":"李之世","text":"海门休道一丸封，黎母江前五指峰。\n飞蜃昔闻成幻市，断鳌今见驾崇墉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27852,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王侯德政咏 其七 花郊驯雉","author":"李之世","text":"青郊如染遍桑麻，烟火茆茨几万家。\n夜户不惊眠犬静，山鸡时啄野桃花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27853,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王侯德政咏 其八 枳邑栖鸾","author":"李之世","text":"皇恩浩浩海波宽，谩说山城借枳鸾。\n九译梯航同捧日，彩凫飞处即长安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27854,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为何凝生题十九首 其一 遂垞","author":"李之世","text":"若个閒人肯住山，青山半老利名关。\n城隅遂垞深深地，恰可乘间一买閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27855,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为何凝生题十九首 其二 且楼","author":"李之世","text":"閒居信不可无楼，且搆飞甍傍小邱。\n楼外青山楼里月，莫教凡客坐当头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27856,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为何凝生题十九首 其三 今门","author":"李之世","text":"森森苔径绿荫繁，白板双支今始门。\n竹里茶烟和露掩，山禽到此也忘喧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27857,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为何凝生题十九首 其四 砚北居","author":"李之世","text":"后置素床前棐几，中间对立我和伊。\n主人心手双閒处，剪下芭蕉叶叶时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27858,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为何凝生题十九首 其五 未了阁","author":"李之世","text":"束之高阁有何用，货向人间不值钱。\n权与蠹鱼分一饱，枉教人认夙生缘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27859,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为何凝生题十九首 其六 绣径","author":"李之世","text":"软风微雨韵轻飏，半为花神洗俗妆。\n径里苍苔堆不尽，流莺衔上薜萝墙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27860,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为何凝生题十九首 其七 清凉界","author":"李之世","text":"偶从火宅咏凉天。\n月挂兰梢个个圆。\n此是瑶台真乐国，银湾浩浩漾婵娟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27861,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为何凝生题十九首 其八 活得七十年便是百四十","author":"李之世","text":"尘忙每叹驹光促，山静方知鸟历长。\n识得坡翁过活法，等閒休把日头量。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27862,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为何凝生题十九首 其九 鉴止","author":"李之世","text":"水鉴澄漪月鉴潭，明明光景递相涵。\n繇来此相非和合，现出空轮与客参。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27863,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为何凝生题十九首 其十 螺室","author":"李之世","text":"我有一庵名曰泡，君今作室像之螺。\n两地盈盈波宛宛，水光月色较谁多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27864,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为何凝生题十九首 其十一 听松步","author":"李之世","text":"移来叶叶带苍云，髣髴涛声寺畔闻。\n佛腊松龄都不记，镌题但认老僧分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27865,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为何凝生题十九首 其十二 浣月池","author":"李之世","text":"分明素影澹盈盈，浣向澄波分外清。\n谁与主人同濯魄，坐看池上月华生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27866,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为何凝生题十九首 其十三 邻佛关","author":"李之世","text":"佛法无边讵有邻，强将和合说缘因。\n悟来是一原非二，佛在虚空也化尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27867,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为何凝生题十九首 其十四 迎凉坐","author":"李之世","text":"炎境趋人著甚忙，挥来褦襶汗如浆。\n君家纵有迎凉坐，输我寒毡一味凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27868,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为何凝生题十九首 其十五 李米祠","author":"李之世","text":"苦吟长吉似秋蝉，老米名颠笔不颠。\n墨沈精魂疑未散，冷香残烬话前缘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27869,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为何凝生题十九首 其十六 为鹤洞","author":"李之世","text":"常闻华表人成鹤，见说孤山鹤似人。\n为鹤为人一间耳，试从云水问分身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27870,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为何凝生题十九首 其十七 莫论世","author":"李之世","text":"谈锋才起合销魂，世事如何到耳根。\n好把胡绵双塞耳，曰馀无听尔休言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27871,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为何凝生题十九首 其十八 止止","author":"李之世","text":"车轮生耳马蹄僵，世路驱人不可当。\n唯有至人堪息影，止止之中是吉祥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27872,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为何凝生题十九首 其十九 竹笑","author":"李之世","text":"世上笑啼半假真，问君笑脸向谁人。\n风前对客娑娑舞，笑罢还疑亦起嗔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27873,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春前一日独酌花下漫兴 其一","author":"李之世","text":"春脚嫌寒不肯临，陈苔委叶径阴阴。\n瓦盘盛得屠苏酒，持向玉兰花下斟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27874,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春前一日独酌花下漫兴 其二","author":"李之世","text":"水烟山霭尽春情，不但花容与鸟声。\n篱壁风光人不管，土牛看罢趁街行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27875,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春前一日独酌花下漫兴 其三","author":"李之世","text":"景寂人閒喜得兼，绝浓峰色又当檐。\n红梅未放春消息，移向山窗护布帘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27876,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"尹世立贻诗索余拙书倚韵有答 其一","author":"李之世","text":"春山和睡恰方浓，鸟印苍苔见字踪。\n欲写残经犹未了，觉来心手正双慵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27877,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"尹世立贻诗索余拙书倚韵有答 其二","author":"李之世","text":"钟肥王瘦费平章，腕鬼心花枉自忙。\n欲讶溪藤信手抹，君家酱醅尽堪藏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27878,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次和尹沾麓春日过访 其一","author":"李之世","text":"春禽啼向水烟中，澹雨潇潇湿翠桐。\n才启洞门惊客到，苍苔先有鹤行踪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27879,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次和尹沾麓春日过访 其二","author":"李之世","text":"蜀茶花发日微矄，片片香光烂火云。\n茗酌合留山衲赏，酒筹应请丽人分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27880,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次和尹沾麓春日过访 其三","author":"李之世","text":"檐角银蟾透画棂，龛灯才了佛前经。\n宵长犹剩閒功课，共把新题写素屏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27881,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次和尹沾麓春日过访 其四","author":"李之世","text":"浅水疏林漫搭庵，无奇可问但玄谈。\n逢君只恐春归去，带雨看花尽湿衫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27882,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对庭柳 其一","author":"李之世","text":"石室西边路稍纡，茆斋新搆古城隅。\n行人乍入迷初径，认得先生柳一株。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27883,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对庭柳 其二","author":"李之世","text":"昔我往矣柳依依，今来转觉柳芳菲。\n枝头黄鸟声声笑，似笑先生去又归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27884,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对庭柳 其三","author":"李之世","text":"手折杨枝手自栽，枝枝今已出墙隈。\n自从雨塌墙无蔽，谁为先生守护来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27885,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对庭柳 其四","author":"李之世","text":"尽日玄蝉咽露枝，午风庭畔柳丝丝。\n乍眠乍起何多事，争似先生睡足时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27886,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"买菊","author":"李之世","text":"诸花惟菊最难种，避雨迎暄却费心。\n自是海南真乐土，百钱买得一篱金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27887,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"移橘","author":"李之世","text":"经秋盘橘绽微黄，日炙风吹别作香。\n飞鸟啄残人不采，满篮争看绿槟榔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27888,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"种扶桑 其一","author":"李之世","text":"繁英暮落早还开，偏向江南处处栽。\n北客见时三叹息，扶桑国里海船来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27889,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"种扶桑 其二","author":"李之世","text":"浪说花王让牡丹，扶桑初日涌金盘。\n嫣红一捻娇无力，可似贵妃醉凭阑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27890,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"插槿","author":"李之世","text":"此是空门不住身，到来香国作花神。\n墙隈篱脚多多插，看取枝头日日新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27891,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"种茉莉","author":"李之世","text":"堪嫁江梅媵水仙，丛丛香雪斗芳妍。\n女郎编绾鬔松髻，却道真珠不值钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27892,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"种芭蕉","author":"李之世","text":"连朝冻雨色青青，滴入芭蕉不肯停。\n藤枕竹床初睡觉，绿窗和墨写黄庭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27893,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"种蔷薇","author":"李之世","text":"蔷薇艳艳灿朝霞，引蔓抽茎的的花。\n此地无冬常似夏，故教红萼管春华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27894,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青茉莉","author":"李之世","text":"姑射轻盈白玉肌，看来疑带绿苔衣。\n妆台珠颗真无价，一串香丝碧玉围。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27895,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"琼土最暖冬至后尚有菊蕊未开者","author":"李之世","text":"炎海无霜菊后开，却留蓓蕾待阳回。\n寒枝未放篱头信，暖律先嘘荻孔灰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27896,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"养鱼","author":"李之世","text":"满注流泉贮石盘，鱼儿吹浪吸青湍。\n看来鱼亦知人意，人欲知鱼有甚难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27897,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]